# Build artifacts for the minimised deployment.
#
# .artifacts/ holds the packed ChromaDB index (~73 MB). It is uploaded to a
# release asset or dataset and downloaded at image build time via CHROMA_URL;
# it must never be committed — it would bloat the repo for no benefit and the
# uncompressed chroma.sqlite3 exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit anyway.
.artifacts/
